Game controller: left stick gimbal, Cross/A records, Circle/B recenters, Square/X 180, Triangle/Y tracks, L1/R1 zoom jumps, L2/R2 hold-to-zoom, D-pad ISO and shutter. Connect/unplug toasts. On-screen stick uses the same gradual speed. Camera Wi-Fi dropping during connect or live recover should retry or return to pairing, not close the app. Long-press ZEBRA: Highlight and Midtone stay above the keyboard; Done dismisses the pad.
